OL,3,GNEWSADog rescued with 83 others 'is
OL,4,Ajust perfect'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA springer spaniel rescued along with
OL,7,F83 others has been rehomed in Hull.
OL,9,FThe dogs were found at a home in
OL,10,FDoncaster in April 2025 living in
OL,11,F"squalid conditions", which RSPCA
OL,12,Fofficers described as "the worst they
OL,13,Fhad encountered during their careers".
OL,15,FCloud is now living with Morgan Bulman,
OL,16,F22, and Luke Shepherd, 29, in Hull, who
OL,17,Fsaid she had taken time to settle but
OL,18,Fwas "just perfect".
