OL,3,GNEWSADog rescued with 83 others 'is
OL,4,Ajust perfect'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuke said: "She's been brilliant. The
OL,7,Ffirst night, she just would not rest. I
OL,8,Fthink that's because she's never
OL,9,Fexperienced anything like sleeping in a
OL,10,Fbed with other people and had that
OL,11,Fcalmness before."
